<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts 3 from priority list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts 3 from priority list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs analyst Joe Moore said Linear Technology Corp has been removed from the brokerage's priority list but remains on its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- He declined to comment immediately on the move.</p>
<p>-- Similarly, market sources said that Altera Corp and PictureTel Corp were also removed from the priority list to the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
